        <UserObject id="n|solidus.public.solidus_promotions_promotion_code_batches" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-kerning: none; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-feature-settings: 'kern' 0, 'liga' 0, 'calt' 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNCIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxNCIgdmlld0JveD0iMCAwIDE0IDE0Ij48cGF0aCBmaWxsPSJub25lIiBzdHJva2U9IiM1ZjZiN2UiIHN0cm9rZS13aWR0aD0iMS4xIiBkPSJNMiAzSDEyVjExSDJaTTIgNS41SDEyTTYgNS41VjExIi8+PC9zdmc+&quot; width=&quot;12&quot; height=&quot;12&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:3px&quot;&gt;solidus_promotions_promotion_code_batches&lt;/span&gt;" table="solidus.public.solidus_promotions_promotion_code_batches" domain="Promotions" description="We allow creating a large number of promotion codes automatically through a background job. This table collects the input for creating such a batch of promotion codes." central="no" indexes="promotion_id" note="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 4px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;solidus.public.solidus_promotions_promotion_code_batches&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 2px&quot;&gt;We allow creating a large number of promotion codes automatically through a background job. This table collects the input for creating such a batch of promotion codes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;color:#7a8597;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;th&gt;Column&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Null&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Default&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Comment&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c98a04;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;PK&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;id&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;bigint&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Primary key of this table.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#2f6fd6;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;FK&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#1f9d8f;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;IX&lt;/span&gt; promotion_id&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;bigint&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;no&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Foreign key to the solidus_promotions_promotions table.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;base_code&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;string&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;no&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;The base code of this promotion code batch, such as &quot;BOATLIFE&quot;.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;number_of_codes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;integer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;no&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;How many codes should be generated.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;join_characters&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;string&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;no&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;_&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;What characters to use for joining the base code with the individual extension, such as &quot;_&quot; for creating &quot;BOATLIFE_S3CR3T&quot;.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c53030;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;PII&lt;/span&gt; email&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;string&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;yes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;After the batch has been created, or in the event of an error, notify this email address.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;error&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;string&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;yes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Error that has occurred during batch processing, if any.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#7c5cc4;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;ENUM&lt;/span&gt; state&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;string&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;yes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;pending&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;What the state of the promotion code batch is: - pending - processing - completed&lt;br&gt;pending — Queued&lt;br&gt;processing — Codes being generated&lt;br&gt;completed — All codes generated&lt;br&gt;failed — Generation failed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;created_at&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;datetime&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;no&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Timestamp indicating when this record was created.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr valign=&quot;top&quot;&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;updated_at&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;datetime&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;no&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td nowrap&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Timestamp indicating when this record was last updated.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:8px 0 2px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;promotion_id&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:8px 0 2px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;References&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;promotion_id → solidus.public.solidus_promotions_promotions.id&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:8px 0 2px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Referenced by&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;solidus.public.solidus_promotions_promotion_codes.promotion_code_batch_id → id&lt;br&gt;"><mxCell style="shape=table;startSize=30;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;columnLines=0;resizeLast=1;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#172033;fillColor=#f7f2d9;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b8c2d0;fontFamily=Inter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DInter%3Awght%40400%3B700" vertex="1" parent="g|solidus/Promotions"><mxGeometry x="885" y="1095" width="340" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
